# One identifier on purpose: this format reads a list of licenses as alternatives.
# The README's License section says which files fall under which terms.
license: MIT
url: "https://ingridkao.netlify.app/lab/"
abstract: "Open practitioner tools for contract and compliance work: checklists, playbooks, review rules and reproducible demonstrations for contract workflows, legal operations and legal AI evaluation, built on public law and on fictional contracts and records. From January 2027 the repository carries a bilingual series, in English and Traditional Chinese, of checklists for Taiwanese semiconductor and AI-hardware suppliers setting up in the United States. Code is released under the MIT License and written material under CC BY 4.0; the README lists what is reserved."
keywords:
